Syntax: cast 'tornado'

This spell creates a tornado to rip asunder all foes in the immediate
vicinity and carrying them off to parts unknown.  The damage from a tornado
is moderate.

Creatures with immunity to summoning and teleportation magic may resist
being swept away by the tornado's teleportation effect, though they will
still take damage from the winds.

This skill, in order to be first obtained, will require a quest.  The
quest will be started by the trainer of this skill at the appropriate
time.  Until this quest is completed, one will not be able to either
perform or practice it.

See Also: TELEPORT, DJALLA'S PROTECTION
